number: 923

title: [Bug]: adapt tool_results format in src/agentscope/memory/_mem0_utils.py

body (full text, not truncated):

**<u>AgentScope is an open-source project. To involve a broader community, we recommend asking your questions in English.</u>**

**Describe the bug**
In  src/agentscope/memory/_mem0_utils, _ASLLM's output format of tool_results is not aligned with mem0's required format. When use config like: 

from mem0.configs import MemoryConfig, GraphStoreConfig
long_term_memory = Mem0LongTermMemory(
        agent_name="Friday",
        user_name="user_123",
        model=DashScopeChatModel(
            model_name="qwen-max-latest",
            api_key=os.environ.get("DASHSCOPE_API_KEY"),
            stream=False,
        ),
        embedding_model=DashScopeTextEmbedding(
            model_name="text-embedding-v3",
            api_key=os.environ.get("DASHSCOPE_API_KEY"),
            dimensions=1024,
        ),
        mem0_config=MemoryConfig(
            graph_store= GraphStoreConfig(
                provider="neo4j",
                config={
            "url": "bolt://xxxxx",
